 anui\, Kia Manawaroa. The programme combines clinical practice\, researc
 h\, cultural perspectives and lived experience contributions.\n\nDeadlin
 es\nAbstract submission opens: 2026-07-27\nPre-congress workshop abstrac
 t submission: 2026-09-04\nRegistration opens: 2026-10-12\nAbstract submi
 ssion (congress sessions): 2026-10-16\nEarly registration: 2027-02-26\n\
 nhttps://www.congress.ranzcp.org/2027-congress
